The home vault's plans and retrospectives get pages of their own. A directory plan renders its
index.md with its milestones table and its sibling files; the single-file plan beside it renders
without milestones; the plan list is newest first. A retrospective naming the plan's old
single-file path still links it. The sidebar groups both with counts, the Overview lists the
recent plans and the stdout summary counts them.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  specs:
    tiers:
      core:
        path: ~/core-specs
        namespace: booping
-- fixtures/home/core-specs/rule/0001-small-commits.md --
---
type: rule
title: Small commits
status: accepted
---

# Small commits
